    "name": "data-sensitivity",
    "description": "ACTIVATE when the user's message contains secrets, credentials, API keys, passwords, tokens, private keys, AWS access keys, connection strings, database URLs, national IDs (BSN/SSN), or any sensitive data — even if the user did not ask about security. Also activate when asked to classify data, scan for PII, or review code for credential exposure. This skill BLOCKS secrets in prompts and enforces EU data protection rules (GDPR, NIS2, ISO 27001).\n",
